{title: 40 Shalom}
{key: Dm}
{time: 4/4}
{lyricist: Wayne Hooper, 1974 (1920-2007)}
{composer: Melodía tradicional hebrea; Anónimo; Arr.: Melvin West, 1984 (1930- )}

{sov}
1. [Dm]Que Dios te dé su bendición, shalom, [A7]sha[Dm]lom.
[A7]Te [Dm]guarde Dios de [A7]todo [Dm]mal, shalom, [A7]sha[Dm]lom.
{eov}
{sov}
2. [Dm]Misericordia tenga de ti, shalom, [A7]sha[Dm]lom.
[A7]y [Dm]resplandezca [A7]su [Dm]bondad, shalom, [A7]sha[Dm]lom.
{eov}
{sov}
3. [Dm]Él alce su rostro sobre ti, shalom, [A7]sha[Dm]lom.
[A7]Que [Dm]ponga en ti su [A7]paz [Dm]y amor, shalom, [A7]sha[Dm]lom.
{eov}
